{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/965995-alex-joneses-of-the-cofd-what-are-some-of-the-craziest-conspiracies","id":965995,"title":"Alex Joneses of the CofD: What are some of the craziest conspiracies?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-09-08T19:41:41-07:00","id":965995,"title":"Alex Joneses of the CofD: What are some of the craziest conspiracies?","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Devil worshiping pedophiles basically run the New World Order. [....] They love death and they love killing babies. </div> </div> </div>I've been reading conspiracy theories lately, because whoa boy, that's some crazy shit, and it's interesting as heck and also terrifying even if it's insane and makes no sense. In fact, I'd go so far as to say it's more terrifying when it makes no sense, it's David Lynchian.<br /> And I've also been thinking about what that kind of thing would be like in a setting made of conspiracies, where the conspiracies are real. While they're not aliens or Jews (or Jewish Aliens), there are groups secretly pulling the strings. So what do the cranks of the <s>World</s>Chronicles of Darkness rave about on talk radio and <span style=\"color:#008000\">green ink</span> websites? Sure, it's easy to just slot the Antagonists into the existing Conspiracy slots (&quot;The God-Machine is building One World Government, <i>WAKE UP SHEEPLE!</i>&quot;), but that's a little boring. I'm more interested in turning the kinds of OOC fan theories people have into the ravings of a madman.<br /> <br /> So what are your weirdest, least reasonable fan theories? What is something that a mortal could spout on the radio and get away with because it's just so insane that the Vampires and Mages feel like it <i>hides</i> the Masquerade behind unbelievable doomsayer prophecies? Specifically, the crossover ones are most interesting. Is the God-Machine a creation of the Exarchs? Is Luna the Dark Mother? <br /> <br /> I figure the Hunter subforums were most fitting, since this kind of clued in (&quot;Clued in&quot;) mortal--whose knowledge of the setting is the same as someone who skimmed through all the supplements, forgot half of it, and is convinced they know the truth--would fit best as a Hunter character, or perhaps an NPC in Hunter.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my first Storyteller's Vault product: <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/product/438661/Pretty-Guardian-Faerie-Knights-A-Hunter-the-Vigil-Conspiracy\" target=\"_blank\">Pretty Guardian Faerie Knights</a><br /> Currently working on <b>Night Horrors: Pushing Daisies</b>. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1517001-%F0%9F%91%BB-a-handful-of-sample-geists\" target=\"_blank\">Sample here</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2998-aspel","name":"Aspel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2998_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"403"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-09T14:40:09-07:00","id":966441,"title":"","content":"This is honestly kinda hard to ponder, because frankly how much more insane can you get beyond Alex Jones?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/483-flyboy254","name":"Flyboy254","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar483_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-09T15:20:46-07:00","id":966461,"title":"","content":"Actually, I really do think the Exarchs built the God-Machine.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My name is Colleen. My favorite song is &quot;Wildwood Flower.&quot; My ambition is to write the complete history of the White Wolf/Onyx Path universe.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11905-julianmoon","name":"JulianMoon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"253"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-09T21:11:57-07:00","id":966586,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Flyboy254</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/965995-alex-joneses-of-the-cofd-what-are-some-of-the-craziest-conspiracies?p=966441#post966441\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This is honestly kinda hard to ponder, because frankly how much more insane can you get beyond Alex Jones?</div> </div> </div> </div>Agreed. The closest I can come to that is taking a real Alex Jones level conspiracy theory and seeing how it comes close to the truth in the CofD, but is still very wrong, kind of like how the overarching plot of Scooby Doo: mystery incorporated was inspired by and referenced the writings of Zecharia Sitchin (along with heaping scoops of Lovecraft, classi